{"id":"poterya","lemma":"потеря","pos":"noun","rank":1912,"glosses":["loss (something lost)","casualty"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8c/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"потери","plural":"потери"},"examples":[{"text":"Это была большая потеря.","en":"It was a great loss.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Его смерть - большая потеря.","en":"His death is a great loss.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"death"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Кто возместит потери?","en":"Who will compensate for the loss?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,null]},{"text":"Это потеря времени и денег.","en":"It's a waste of time and money.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"money","l":"деньги"}]},{"text":"Он ослабел от потери крови.","en":"He was weak from the loss of blood.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"blood","l":"кровь"}]}]}